{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "4ed0fa14646f8df9c95fc9181350f7e7025e13b8eac87ba47db730a36fc281db", "ja": "冷たく濡れた心", "zh": "湿冷的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "149195d08b588795876badd95b43180c2cedcf03c0ee24d5559d5b29339853fe", "ja": "自分はセンターとリーダーに相応しくない、\n後任は恵美にしたいと相談する琴葉。しかし\n恵美は猛反発、琴葉と衝突の末、走り去って\nしまう。海美から恵美の気持ちを聞かされ、\n自分の発言を後悔する琴葉。", "zh": "琴叶认为自己不适合担任Center与队长，\n因而提议由惠美接替她的位置。\n然而，惠美强烈反对，在与琴叶起冲突后愤而离去。\n琴叶从海美口中得知惠美的想法，\n开始后悔自己说了那些话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a27268727d1dcc445b233bb87973c25194f2ddb04536b407de87aefa490e9624", "ja": "（灼熱少女のレッスンは順調に進んでいる。\n公演本番まで、あと少し……）", "zh": "（『灼热少女』的训练进行得很顺利。\n距离正式公演还剩一点时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "21c7a00899ec3883055b6f75b6c1529f8b7a8efddbc7dc85b122775b1a4e8e53", "ja": "（ショッピングモールでのミニステージも結果的には\n成功したし、この勢いに乗っていきたいところだな）", "zh": "（在购物中心的小型表演从结果来说很成功，\n希望公演能乘着这股气势再创佳绩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "997ad3aedc138bfd9b7e4bd339f0d474927b8e25033deebbc79c8a70c868f7aa", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあの、少し、お時間いただけますか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n请问，我能借用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ac2ebee1e6f30df9356e3052e78bcabc53746a53b0415632eb0f33c5a084265b", "ja": "お、琴葉。どうした、灼熱少女のことか？", "zh": "哦，琴叶，怎么了？是『灼热少女』的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "4e0dc712ce772a78aad1b2a80495db35769e67d6eb05581394dbcc0fa40049c0", "ja": "はい。あの、今になってこんなことを言い出すのは、\nご迷惑だろうとわかってはいるのですが……。", "zh": "是的。那个，我知道现在才说这种话，\n会给你们添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1ccebd460a24a89baf487c249ed7bd4ea1dbb0e84c39bb92e81da5b3055ec9d", "ja": "けど、やっぱり大事なことだと思うので\nお話しします。", "zh": "但是，我还是觉得这件事很重要，\n想跟你谈一谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "66aeaf4a808bf68d1464ed9a5b130cee2fd4aa82868cb3874f92747509a0e239", "ja": "{$P$}。私は灼熱少女のリーダーと\nセンターには、相応しくないのではないでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，我是不是不适合担任\n『灼热少女』的队长与Center呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bbc179485e107119d3a79ee6b0764d075c65eb7b5cf24b3f13a2c889a5545c78", "ja": "えっ！？　ど、どうしたんだ、急に？", "zh": "什么！？你、你怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "18b81d79385286ea7e515c65b12056f29d73394e9f3f2a8a54a2370f3f6b7512", "ja": "いや……そうか。\nこの前のミニステージのことを、気にしてるのか？", "zh": "等等……我知道了。\n你很在意之前小型表演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "80332831246fa13a43c6d19a11d407f40e2a62659c5d89310dd849e9add2fb95", "ja": "はい。あの時、私はお客さんたちの注意を、\n満足に引くことができませんでした。", "zh": "是的，当时我无法充分引起观众的注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "61720635f57e09e5465c4c01b3745e6bf4fd35e1daf6a89200a4811b817151a9", "ja": "ですから灼熱少女のためにも、センターには\nもっと華のある子がいいんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "所以我在想，为了『灼热少女』，\n是不是应该由更有魅力的人来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "25cdaf07f3e984023cdd0ef3bb7f5f13e21b62e1f5c73ab0382738d357cc06c3", "ja": "そんなことは……いや。\nとにかく、意見は最後まで聞こう。それで？", "zh": "没有这回事……不，我先听你说完吧。\n然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "0da4aaeb2587d587460dd5ba2b7d3fa29ee61ecc3d2579e2c56e3336780b54e7", "ja": "いえ、私の意見は今言ったとおりです。\n後任は、恵美がいいと思います。", "zh": "我已经说完了，以上就是我的意见。\n我认为惠美是很适合的继任人选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "c42ff65a2e7ae5fabfc3fffc3e3184074160534647d4ec4d6f03d95609f6a909", "ja": "恵美ならお客さんを盛り上げるのも上手だし、\nリーダーとしても、みんなをまとめられるかと。", "zh": "惠美很擅长带动观众，\n应该也能胜任队长带领大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a682ffb6b36283cd1c2b05ead29143d99c2102fee6a387a23aaccef07fbdb43b", "ja": "うーん……まあ、恵美への評価には同意だよ。\nリーダーの器もあると思う。", "zh": "唔～嗯……是没错，我认同你对惠美的评价，\n她也有成为队长的资质。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "f7f3933626f7403f9f31c909ea11e8b4bd68ac7acbf5487aae6a190e4b96b198", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね！　よかった。\nそれじゃあ……。", "zh": "我果然没看走眼！太好了。\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c0fe6029d580713fa0ea3eb65226c9e4595dd9a05e2c26b8c74e982837322046", "ja": "いや、ちょっと待ってくれ琴葉。\nそれとこれとは別問題だ。", "zh": "不，等一下，琴叶。\n这是两码子事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "647c5813eed5e1b4d03cb5ef5ab7b7bb941b8f88194494f80dd724acce5cc662", "ja": "え？　でも、話はもう……。", "zh": "咦？可是，我要说的已经……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9c9d9eab1d2c02cdbc8940cbdeab8b18d46b3a2e989be420b40387f3ab502bb", "ja": "おっはよ～！　……ありゃ？\n{$P$}と琴葉、どったの？", "zh": "早啊～！……哎呀？\n{$P$}跟琴叶，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "e72dc8cdc3c024c68946bc2728e631b6249529e43bb46e6d478ebd21107174f9", "ja": "恵美、ちょうどよかった！　今、リーダーとセンターを\n恵美に代わってもらおうっていう話をしてて……。", "zh": "惠美，你来得正好！我们正在讨论说，\n要拜托惠美代替我担任队长跟Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "3c08df8284d8328d2bd3aecbf17a0513435b83ad30a5511f5eb6580d1bd7c805", "ja": "はあ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "10b9e151d549b48082ed30e84be2d061e73c62591e0de99bd4071fa0f084ce29", "ja": "えええっ！？　リーダーって、灼熱少女の？\nな、なんで？　どーして？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？队长是指『灼热少女』的队长？\n为、为什么？怎么会～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "2163936f29d955aa7b5538682b762d0378013bdf5dcf88b7c04d759bf2c193bd", "ja": "いや海美、アタシに聞かれても……あっ！　ははーん、\n琴葉ってば、まだこの前のコト気にしてんの？", "zh": "不是啊海美，你问我我问谁……啊！\n我知道了，琴叶你还在介意上次的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "35dc0698c5e88d6222a079170d290ef685ff7edaabec0c12af55fa3fb917420b", "ja": "だから、アレはたまたまアタシ達のアドリブが上手く\nいっただけで……な、なんでそんなマジな顔してんの？", "zh": "我不是说了，那次只是我们的即兴演出凑巧成功……\n你、你怎么露出那么严肃的表情啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "6aa85077dd0000ae7e023ded62db5f696841cffebc27a728d5e2720de6b25960", "ja": "だって本気だもの。私なんかより、\n灼熱少女の中心には恵美が相応しいと思う。", "zh": "因为我是认真的呀。比起我这种人，\n我认为惠美更适合站在『灼热少女』的中心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "b94d9d6cdcd77b14a877d9eb289ee720c8b3adb5597162417752dac3f8bbebfe", "ja": "いやいや、おかしいでしょ！　なんでそうなるの？\nアタシがリーダーとか、絶対無理だっての！", "zh": "不不不，太莫名其妙了吧！怎么会做出这种结论啦？\n要我当队长什么的，我绝对办不到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "d84d5661562b9176ae850ffc4f8920f5879eeee090e4bbf1c89e23676d438f64", "ja": "んも～、冗談にしちゃ面白くないし。\nあんまりしつこいと、怒るよ？", "zh": "真是的～就算是开玩笑也一点都不好笑。\n你要是再讲下去，我就要生气啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "36a98f6f1cf93dd73bedcc89eb65c91e634c29953f33db7ff7f7996336e1a489", "ja": "冗談なんかでこんなこと言わないよ。私は本気。\n今度の灼熱少女の公演は、絶対に成功させたいし……。", "zh": "我才不会说这种话来开玩笑，我很认真。\n我绝对要让『灼热少女』这次的公演成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "d0004f44ace98ea8d4c5f37176623f69a1276b9c9bc510210358d1cbe1ad1fa1", "ja": "だからそのためにも、アイドルとして未熟な私が\n目立つところにいちゃダメだと思うの。", "zh": "我认为要达成这个目标，\n我这个不够成熟的偶像，不该站在醒目的位置上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "09e98bf0acfa22d26dba484c2ecfc0d3ba8982c79179c796b56de3059a1abafd", "ja": "だ、だからって、急にそんなコト言われても……\nアタシだって、心の準備ってモノがさ？　ね、海美？", "zh": "就、就算这样，你突然这么说我也没办法……\n至少也要让我有心理准备啊。对吧，海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e77eb1e2ab8f02623eaef453919a34657c0815bb637367b830f0891a2d43521", "ja": "う……うんうん、そうだよね！\nも、もーっ、やだなー琴葉ってば！", "zh": "对……对啊对啊，就是说啊！\n真、真是的，讨厌啦～琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "c29b68f23675c20218dba2f72a319373cc07cfe641098689d9c26329724c7399", "ja": "そんなコト言ってると、\n私がセンターやっちゃうぞ～☆　な～んて……。", "zh": "你再说这种话，我就要抢走Center的位置啰～☆\n才～怪啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "a2ea06514b37ffee5865dcd60f6e20a6c0c8c84d98d0a298e7afec5194cb82ce", "ja": "海美ちゃんがセンター？\n……そっか。それもいいかも……。", "zh": "海美当Center？\n……这样啊，这主意也许不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "a75f588ec51c80ee0bd6d5ee70a14396ff2473fcaea52971f60d922adab28d1d", "ja": "うえっ！！？", "zh": "咦！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "6ac800a156ed7c1649a851c1c04e7da88de56a33ce2f44b3cddba049fbd8ab3b", "ja": "こんな時期にセンターとリーダーを両方なんて、\nたしかに現実的なお願いじゃなかったかもしれない。", "zh": "要在这种时期同时继任Center跟队长，\n确实是不切实际的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "db7ccc82c283e2dedde01e5b06dc9eb3fdadc5e3851afdd043816486b6f0cc7a", "ja": "でも、ふたりで片方ずつだけなら、どう？\n海美ちゃんなら、センターに申し分ないと思うし……。", "zh": "但如果换成两个人分别继任一个职位呢？\n如果是海美，担任Center再适合不过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "2c0bfce8a7e54a19348dd29501cebb77e985f4d23323c513f6a7353957c435c2", "ja": "や、やだやだ琴葉、そんなコト言わないでよ！？\n今のなし、冗談だってば！", "zh": "不、不行不行，琴叶，你别说这种话啦！\n刚才那句话不算，我只是开玩笑啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "0bf58e4c8e9ad54834d7b508094a1f6ea110849b8cc46f36aba610adcd5b9b90", "ja": "いい加減にしなよ、琴葉！\nアタシ、ホントに怒るからねッ！？", "zh": "你别再闹了，琴叶！\n我真的要生气了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "988aaf4279e61295a204e365a2cdca833a94142311e5cf8e00a916f2c890f889", "ja": "恵美や海美ちゃんには、私の気持ちはわからないよ。\n……何でもできる、ふたりには……。", "zh": "惠美和海美根本不懂我的心情。\n……无所不能的你们，根本就不懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "a6ea41ed306210e611cea18bc3bb2a5ebbbece3707df71bb0f540f7df4139b04", "ja": "はあ！？　何でもって……何言ってんの！？\n琴葉こそ、アタシ達の気持ちわかってないじゃん！", "zh": "啊！？什么叫无所不能……你在说什么啊！？\n琴叶你才是，根本不懂我们的心情嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "3f8b3d85a3af3252e5b3a2becd8003116aab29a466a6dfd45eff712a6e9c23c7", "ja": "～～もういい。アタシ、帰るッ！", "zh": "～～够了，我要回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "e275bee541f81db27f838ced9ffa5b02d6c7c75d09f941072b0260d77ca8e10d", "ja": "あっ！？　め、めぐみー！？", "zh": "啊！？阿、阿惠！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "31812b604ffcb9ade2ef4195ca11ad1381fa256bc747c633f52913610f383e37", "ja": "……おや～？", "zh": "……哎呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "6630d2883153339f9ff07870260a66a2724824c8015c7a68f4b4887eeb7af1a0", "ja": "今、恵美ちゃんとすれ違いましたけど～。\nどうかしたんですか～？", "zh": "我们来的时候正好看到惠美离开～\n发生什么事了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "85fe70ae9f4f555d8f5abc8c47881bb842626e2057322eccb93483c589cb38bd", "ja": "なんかめぐみ、すっごくこわいかおしてた……。", "zh": "惠美刚才的表情好可怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "a72e4e0dff8833daf0f1b8890df5bd073299c0de64e249111a35112f7c4147db", "ja": "あのさ、琴葉……。灼熱少女のレッスン初日、\n私とめぐみーだけ、お仕事で先に帰ったでしょ？", "zh": "那个，琴叶……『灼热少女』第一天训练时，\n我跟阿惠不是因为工作先走了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "4933f9d25af348579bc9389a67334d972de3c4f1f42ac756a75f05fbca400580", "ja": "あのとき、めぐみー言ってたんだよ。\n琴葉は何でもカンペキで、自慢の友達なんだーって。", "zh": "那时候阿惠就说过，\n琴叶凡事都很完美，是她引以为傲的朋友喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1049_029umi", "source_sha256": "11588995eb74b34f9751e63dc2a7dd460f50066120dc8634eb08576923e31baf", "ja": "その大好きな人が、自分なんか……って言ってたら。\n私だったら、ちょっと悲しいかな……。", "zh": "见到这么喜欢的人……用「我这种人」这样自我贬低。\n换做是我，或许会觉得有点难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1050_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab450bba41a9d85e76a531b05edee6e2e346be99172b05cf79d598f1812ff5ab", "ja": "だって、大好きな人への自分の気持ちが、\n全然届いてないってコトでしょ……？", "zh": "因为这就代表我这么喜欢那个人的心情，\n完全没有传达到对方的心里对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1052_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac1912aef3c35146b37f681e2451e8d3b29c8c8087b37e84d1cde80ee23e3375", "ja": "そんな……私、全然知らなくて……。\nど、どうしよう。恵美……。", "zh": "怎么会……我完全不知道……\n怎、怎么办？惠美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1053_p", "source_sha256": "200b15a058782bfb62e900e2770d89bfe21b3a500eecbfe57534ac7226e950b6", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、琴葉。恵美の様子は俺が見てくる。\nすまないが、少し待っていてくれるか？", "zh": "放心吧，琴叶，我去看看惠美的情况。\n不好意思，你可以稍微等我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "8a9623e2acb31906228a0b58563551fb425456b0d2d01504701413d286fa9425", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました。\nすみません、お願いします……。", "zh": "{$P$}……我明白了。\n对不起，麻烦你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "2da6b8a621a55f3e5fa494be2aa08f0d51ad52ab7ea9ff78765860dabc7c1f84", "ja": "（恵美、遠くに行っていなければいいが……）", "zh": "（希望惠美没有走得太远……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
